      div(id = "pasa-about-content", class = "pasa-document-sections",
      about_md,
      tags$hr(),
      h3("Input data format"),
      p("Use a wide numeric table: the first column is wavelength in nm (a name resembling 'nm' or 'wavelength' is auto-detected), and every remaining column is one sample. A header row is required. PASA cannot infer whether sample values are absorbance, optical density, absorption coefficient, or another quantity; retain and report the source units and measurement basis."),
      h4("Accepted file types"),
