          p(tags$b("Operational tiers: "), "Very high shape similarity (r ≥ 0.995 and SAM ≤ 2°), High shape similarity (r ≥ 0.99 and SAM ≤ 4°), Moderate shape similarity (r ≥ 0.95 and SAM ≤ 10°), otherwise Lower shape similarity."),
          p("The 2nd-derivative correlation (r_d2) is an advisory diagnostic only and does not drive the tier because its behavior was variable in development checks. It is computed from a wavelength-local cubic polynomial with tri-cube weights over a 15 nm window. At least 8 jointly supported derivative nodes and non-negligible variation are required; coarse grids may not supply enough points in this window. The display-smoothing toggle cannot move it."),
